    "title": "Universal Remote Samsung TV",
    "description": "<b>Why Samsung Universal TV Remote</b>\r\nConvert your mobile device into Samsung Universal TV Remote and get rid of drained batteries and broken plastic remotes. \r\n\r\n<b>Supported Samsung Smart TV's</b>\r\n<b>- -</b> Supports All Samsung Smart TV with Taizen OS\r\n\r\nThis remote control for Samsung TV supports <b>Taizen OS</b> and Traditional <b>IR</b> devices.\r\n\r\n<b>Network Compatibility</b>\r\nTo use Samsung Smart TV Remote your Samsung Smart TV and your mobile device must be on the same Wi-Fi Network, once the Smart TV is detected then you will have to give one time access to Samsung Universal TV Remote\r\n\r\n<b>Traditional IR Devices</b>\r\nSupports all traditional Samsung TV's, your phone must have IR blaster in it for using the Samsung TV Remote\r\n\r\n<b> Functionality </b>\r\n- ON / OFF \r\n- Volume Control's\r\n- Channel Control's\r\n- Mute\r\n- Navigation Control's\r\n- Multi Media Control's\r\n- Home\r\n- Touch Pad\r\n- Many More\r\n- For Traditional Samsung TV Remote, supports all the functions in the remote.\r\n\r\n<b> Android TV </b>\r\nIn addition to Samsung Smart TV, our Remote Control for Samsung Smart TV Supports Android Chromecast OS, WebOS, Taizen OS.\r\n\r\n<b> Smart TV Remote Can be used </b>\r\n- Samsung Universal TV Remote\r\n- Samsung Smart TV Remote\r\n\r\n<b>Disclaimer</b>\r\nThis app is not an official Samsung application. We are not affiliated with Samsung Electronics in any way, we have just presented it in a better way.\r\n\r\n<b>Reach Us</b>\r\nIf in any case your Samsung Smart TV Remote is not getting connected please reach us at nabasmarttvremote@gmail.com. We are always working to improve our product.",
